<title>USA: Matthews Studio completes acquisition.</title>
<headline>Matthews Studio completes acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>BURBANK, Calif. 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Matthews Studio Equipment Group, an equipment supplier to the entertainment industry, on Thursday said it has completed its acquisition of privately held Media Lighting Supply Inc, based in Miami.</p>
<p>The acquisition strategically expands the access of Matthews unit, Expendable Supply Store, to the southeastern United States, Caribbean, Central and South American markets.</p>
<p>The deal is valued at close to $1 million and was paid in a combination of cash and stock options, Matthews said in a statement.</p>
</text>
